          "text": "The capital of Australia is **Canberra**.\n\nIt was chosen as the site for the nation's capital in 1908 as a compromise between Sydney and Melbourne, Australia's two largest cities. Located in the Australian Capital Territory (ACT), Canberra serves as the seat of the Australian government.",
